thub.com/esixtosr/NetFlow","external":"https://esixtosr.github.io/NetFlow/network/home-lab/","cta":null},"html":"<p>An interactive network topology visualization tool inspired by Cisco Packet Tracer. NetFlow was designed to map infrastructure layouts, visualize VLAN segmentation, and document real-world network architectures.</p>\n<p>The project allows users to create devices, define connections, organize VLAN environments, and export network diagrams for documentation and analysis.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"12U Bare-Metal Homelab","cover":{"publicURL":"/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/Unifi_Dashboard.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/52861/Unifi_Dashboard.png","srcSet":"/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/aece0/Unifi_Dashboard.png 175w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/dea39/Unifi_Dashboard.png 350w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/52861/Unifi_Dashboard.png 700w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/655c4/Unifi_Dashboard.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/dee2e/Unifi_Dashboard.avif 175w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/02566/Unifi_Dashboard.avif 350w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/eb275/Unifi_Dashboard.avif 700w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/dbd0e/Unifi_Dashboard.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/a2e69/Unifi_Dashboard.webp 175w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/ec351/Unifi_Dashboard.webp 350w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/f7346/Unifi_Dashboard.webp 700w,\n/static/8702f5859fc8a6b032e0c921eb389d86/62fee/Unifi_Dashboard.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":403}}},"gif":null,"gallery":[{"publicURL":"/static/9422537eb3bf0071f6a2e210a9da8c58/Closed_Server_Rack.jpg"},{"publicURL":"/static/ba39f6f878837c361aaae1a93881eca2/Opened_Server_Rack.jpg"},{"publicURL":"/static/7d6cd119ca453bdf26a3c0f00f03ad7f/Port_Connections.png"},{"publicURL":"/static/8dedd4f2de499286c3a5f9fe72c849f9/NetFlow_Topology.png"}],"tech":["UniFi","Proxmox","VLANs","Network Engineering","Bare Metal"],"github":"https://github.com/esixtosr/12U-Bare-Metal-Homelab","external":null,"cta":null},"html":"<p>A compact 12U bare-metal homelab built for network segmentation, infrastructure services, virtualization, and hands-on systems administration.</p>\n<p>The rack combines physical server hardware, UniFi networking, managed switching, VLAN planning, and documentation-focused topology work to support cybersecurity, networking, and self-hosted service projects.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"CryptoChat","cover":{"publicURL":"/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/ce566/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.png","srcSet":"/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/250de/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.png 175w,\n/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/d772d/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.png 350w,\n/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/ce566/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.png 700w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/4d970/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.avif 175w,\n/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/8ff46/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.avif 350w,\n/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/da6dc/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.avif 700w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/ca708/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.webp 175w,\n/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/a3b84/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.webp 350w,\n/static/4454aeb077ddd06f059b4e572ae35bb5/25a46/01-cryptochat-main-verified-chat.webp 700w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":489}}},"gif":null,"gallery":[{"publicURL":"/static/d962687ee5a77353110d8feffc123942/02-cryptochat-fingerprint-verification.png"},{"publicURL":"/static/d5b685ef73c31e47199aa9ebd8d32ad0/03-cryptochat-architecture.svg"},{"publicURL":"/static/ed273a693c0bf99d1fadcb294b6e34ab/04-cryptochat-wireshark-encrypted-traffic.png"},{"publicURL":"/static/12600d9054a53dc6b7c2077318762a84/05-cryptochat-collapsed-sidebar.png"},{"publicURL":"/static/e7248fb5cd0bd7b60535d6432686a3ac/06-cryptochat-disconnected-state.png"}],"tech":["Python","Cryptography","X25519","AES-GCM","TCP","Wireshark"],"github":"https://github.com/esixtosr/CryptoChat","external":null,"cta":null},"html":"<p>CryptoChat is an encrypted peer-to-peer messaging project focused on practical secure communication concepts, including key exchange, authenticated encryption, and trust-on-first-use fingerprint verification.</p>\n<p>The project demonstrates how two peers can establish a shared secret, derive encryption keys, verify identities through fingerprints, and exchange encrypted messages over TCP while validating the result with packet-level inspection.</p>"}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"title":"Build a Spotify Connected App","cover":{"publicURL":"/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/course-card.png","childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/png;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/bc3b9/course-card.png","srcSet":"/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/9a130/course-card.png 175w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/a3fa1/course-card.png 350w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/bc3b9/course-card.png 700w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/87926/course-card.png 1400w","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/dae43/course-card.avif 175w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/d7667/course-card.avif 350w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/7ec1a/course-card.avif 700w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/71a30/course-card.avif 1400w","type":"image/avif","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"},{"srcSet":"/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/5d873/course-card.webp 175w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/26a00/course-card.webp 350w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/f23f0/course-card.webp 700w,\n/static/4e06bd39766c182ea26b255309b1dee1/2c2d0/course-card.webp 1400w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 700px) 700px, 100vw"}]},"width":700,"height":394}}},"gif":null,"gallery":[{"publicURL":"/static/c71359e46075f4ad34b6c6bdc2288f5e/demo.png"}],"tech":["React","Express","Spotify API","Styled Components"],"github":null,"external":"https://www.newline.co/courses/build-a-spotify-connected-app","cta":"https://www.newline.co/courses/build-a-spotify-connected-app"},"html":"<p>Having struggled with understanding how the Spotify OAuth flow works, I made the course I wish I could have had.</p>\n<p>Unlike tutorials that only cover a few concepts and leave you with half-baked GitHub repositories, this course covers everything from explaining the principles of REST APIs to implementing Spotify's OAuth flow and fetching API data in a React app. By the end of the course, you’ll have an app deployed to the internet you can add to your portfolio.</p>"}}]}}}